  "<div class=\"sk-head\">\n      <span>Body schopností: <b>{0}</b> voľné · {1}/10 (1 bod každých 5 úrovní)</span>\n      <label>Q <select data-sksel=\"0\">{2}</select></label>\n      <label>Shift <select data-sksel=\"1\">{3}</select></label>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-skreset {4}>Vrátiť body</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sk-grid\">{5}{6}</div>\n    <p class=\"note\">1. bod schopnosti ju vylepší, 2. bod odomkne jednu z dvoch modifikácií (medzi nimi môžeš neskôr prepínať zadarmo). Vrátenie bodov je zadarmo. Auto-schopnosti zapneš v Menu (≡).</p>": "<div class=\"sk-head\">\n      <span>Skill points: <b>{0}</b> free · {1}/10 (1 point every 5 levels)</span>\n      <label>Q <select data-sksel=\"0\">{2}</select></label>\n      <label>Shift <select data-sksel=\"1\">{3}</select></label>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-skreset {4}>Refund points</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sk-grid\">{5}{6}</div>\n    <p class=\"note\">The 1st point upgrades a skill, the 2nd unlocks one of two modifiers (you can switch between them later for free). Refunding points is free. Turn on Auto-skills in the Menu (≡).</p>",
