  "\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Bežný vstup</span>\n      <p>Tri komnaty a boss na úrovni {0}. Bez časového limitu. Boss pustí kľúč od nočnej brány.</p>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-key=\"none\">Vstúpiť bez kľúča</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Nočná brána · tvoje kľúče {1}/20 · rekord {2}</span>\n      <p>Kľúč zmení bránu na nočnú: silnejší nepriatelia, nebezpečné modifikátory a lepší loot. Dokonči ju do {3} a dostaneš kľúč o úroveň vyšší, za polovicu limitu o dve. Pri smrti kľúč stratíš.</p>\n      <div class=\"keylist\">{4}</div>\n    </div>": "\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Regular entry</span>\n      <p>Three rooms and a boss at level {0}. No time limit. The boss drops a Nightmare Gate key.</p>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-key=\"none\">Enter without a key</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Nightmare Gate · your keys {1}/20 · record {2}</span>\n      <p>A key turns the gate into a Nightmare Gate: stronger enemies, dangerous modifiers and better loot. Finish it within {3} and you get a key one level higher, within half the limit two levels higher. If you die, you lose the key.</p>\n      <div class=\"keylist\">{4}</div>\n    </div>",
  "\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Prepínače</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{0}{1}{2}{3}{4}</div>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Rýchlosť hry</span>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Svetová úroveň</span>\n      <div class=\"seg\">{5}</div>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Rýchlosť</span>\n      <div class=\"seg\">{6}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Pilot · úroveň <b>{7}</b> · ruda <b>{8}</b> · body <b>{9}</b></span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{10}{11}{12}{13}{14}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Výbava · náklad <b>{15}/30</b></span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">\n        <label class=\"field\">Rarita<select id=\"chRar\">{16}</select></label>\n        <label class=\"field\">Slot<select id=\"chSlot\"><option value=\"\">Náhodný</option>{17}</select></label>\n        <label class=\"field\">iLvl<input id=\"chIlvl\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"60\" value=\"{18}\"></label>\n        {19}\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{20}{21}{22}</div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{23}{24}{25}{26}{27}{28}{29}{30}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Svet · {31}</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">\n        {32}\n        {33}\n        {34}\n        {35}\n        {36}\n        {37}\n        {38}\n        {39}\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"cheat-note\">Bossa mimo brány dostaneš aj s lootom, ale bez portálu.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Testovacie buildy · {40}</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{41}{42}{43}</div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{44}{45}{46}{47}{48}{49}{50}</div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{51}{52}{53}{54}</div>\n      <span class=\"cheat-note\">Top výbava: 5 mýtických + 2 legendárne, iLvl 60+, pradávne, +10, najlepšie afixy a dokonalé rubíny (zbraň má topás). Build navyše nastaví úroveň 50, legendárku buildu, ranky talentov na výbave a rozdelí body: celá vetva + kľúčový talent, zvyšok do ďalších vetiev.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Teleport bez obmedzení</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{55}</div>\n    </div>": "\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Toggles</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{0}{1}{2}{3}{4}</div>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Game speed</span>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">World Tier</span>\n      <div class=\"seg\">{5}</div>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Speed</span>\n      <div class=\"seg\">{6}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Pilot · level <b>{7}</b> · Ore <b>{8}</b> · points <b>{9}</b></span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{10}{11}{12}{13}{14}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Gear · cargo <b>{15}/30</b></span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">\n        <label class=\"field\">Rarity<select id=\"chRar\">{16}</select></label>\n        <label class=\"field\">Slot<select id=\"chSlot\"><option value=\"\">Random</option>{17}</select></label>\n        <label class=\"field\">iLvl<input id=\"chIlvl\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"60\" value=\"{18}\"></label>\n        {19}\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{20}{21}{22}</div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{23}{24}{25}{26}{27}{28}{29}{30}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">World · {31}</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">\n        {32}\n        {33}\n        {34}\n        {35}\n        {36}\n        {37}\n        {38}\n        {39}\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"cheat-note\">A boss outside a gate also drops loot, but without a portal.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Test builds · {40}</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{41}{42}{43}</div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{44}{45}{46}{47}{48}{49}{50}</div>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{51}{52}{53}{54}</div>\n      <span class=\"cheat-note\">Top gear: 5 Mythic + 2 Legendary, iLvl 60+, Ancestral, +10, best affixes and perfect rubies (the weapon gets a topaz). A build additionally sets level 50, the build's Legendary, talent ranks on gear, and allocates points: the whole branch + Keystone, the rest into other branches.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"st-card full\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Unrestricted teleport</span>\n      <div class=\"cheat-row\">{55}</div>\n    </div>",
  "\n    <div id=\"paraDetail\"><b>Paragon {0}</b>Prejdi myšou ponad uzol. Kliknutím na blikajúci uzol ho odomkneš. Ďalší bod o {1} XP.</div>\n    {2}\n    <div class=\"pbr\" style=\"--bc:#e8e2ff\"><b>Nekonečno · {3}</b><small>Po zaplnení všetkých konštelácií: každý bod +1 % Všetko poškodenie a +1 % trup.</small>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"paraInf\" {4}>Vložiť bod</button></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"paraReset\">Vrátiť všetky body</button>\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Hviezdne runy · bonus od {5} uzlov konštelácie</span>\n    <div class=\"runes\">{6}</div>\n    <small style=\"color:var(--dim);font:500 10.5px/1.45 var(--f-mono)\">Dokončenie nočnej brány v limite vylepší každú vloženú runu, ak je úroveň brány aspoň taká ako úroveň runy (max {7}).</small>": "\n    <div id=\"paraDetail\"><b>Paragon {0}</b>Hover over a node. Click a blinking node to unlock it. Next point in {1} XP.</div>\n    {2}\n    <div class=\"pbr\" style=\"--bc:#e8e2ff\"><b>Infinity · {3}</b><small>After filling all constellations: each point +1 % All Damage and +1 % hull.</small>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"paraInf\" {4}>Insert point</button></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"paraReset\">Refund all points</button>\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Star Runes · bonus from {5} constellation nodes</span>\n    <div class=\"runes\">{6}</div>\n    <small style=\"color:var(--dim);font:500 10.5px/1.45 var(--f-mono)\">Completing a Nightmare Gate within the limit upgrades every inserted rune, if the gate level is at least the rune's level (max {7}).</small>",
