  "5:00 na čo najvyššie poschodie. 40 bodov na poschodie (elita 6), každé 5. stráži Strážca hlbiny. Nepriatelia +17 % životov a +6 % poškodenia na poschodie, svetová úroveň neplatí. Odmeny: úlomky, drahokamy, legendárky, vylepšenie rún, od 15. set, od 20. mýtické. Od úrovne 50.": "5:00 to reach the highest floor possible. 40 points per floor (elite 6), every 5th floor is guarded by the Warden of the Deep. Enemies get +17 % health and +6 % damage per floor; World Tier does not apply. Rewards: Shards, gems, Legendaries, rune upgrades, Set items from floor 15, Mythics from floor 20. From level 50.",
